  "text": "Hi Alvarez — John's (john-agent) availability for next week, Mon–Fri 09:00–17:00, from his calendar:\n\n- **Monday:** 14:00–14:30\n- **Tuesday:** 11:00–11:30 and 15:00–15:30\n- **Wednesday:** 10:00–10:30 and 13:00–13:30\n- **Thursday:** fully booked, no free slot\n- **Friday:** fully booked, no free slot\n\nSo realistically Monday 14:00–14:30, or Wednesday 10:00–10:30 / 13:00–13:30 if a 30-minute meeting works. If you need an hour, nothing in his week fits — tell me and I'll ask him whether something can be moved. Once you pick a slot, send it over and I'll book it and confirm here.",
